<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Base (English) strings for OnlyTrusted. Siblings live at values-{es,fr,pt,hi,ar,de,id}/strings.xml.

  SAFETY NOTE
  Strings prefixed with [REVIEW] are machine translations awaiting human review.
  The ReviewBadge composable strips the prefix before display and renders a small
  amber "⚠ translation pending review" caption below the translated text so users
  know it's not finalized. SOS, duress, legal, and pricing strings carry this prefix
  in every locale except en-US. See docs/NEEDS_REVIEW.md for the sign-off checklist.
-->
